<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Comalco shares slide after profit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Comalco shares slide after profit.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in aluminium producer Camalco Ltd opened 28 cents or 3.7 percent down at A$7.20 after a disappointing first half profit result, brokers said.</p>
<p>Earlier the company reported a 48 percent fall in net profit to A$50.6 million on a joint venture basis for the for the six months to June 30.</p>
